{"2427310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heróis de Noname - Acesso Antecipado", "steam_appid": 2427310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [2628840, 3124250], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/0631ce2c85c5275a45a6eb28cf750ddb.avif?t=1738407926\" width=616 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/bee7c9fc85f1ba8f873533c226f63e50.poster.avif?t=1738407926\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/bee7c9fc85f1ba8f873533c226f63e50.webm?t=1738407926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Welcome to the Early Access of Heroes of Noname!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/81043634689b24c6a62d8d98243974c9.webp?t=1738407926\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/81043634689b24c6a62d8d98243974c9.poster.avif?t=1738407926\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, you'll have the opportunity to be a part of the game's development and even leave your mark on it, with your name in the credits or an in-game tribute based on your contributions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/4168a8cc1dd136af3994483342b9ed13.avif?t=1738407926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras_big/4168a8cc1dd136af3994483342b9ed13.avif?t=1738407926 width=800 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes of Noname is an RPG focused on exploration and combat. Explore a massive, ever-expanding world. Recruit unique characters. Find and combine various items to customize your characters. Multiple minigames and seasonal content. Join our Discord and become a part of our growing community! Share your experience, report bugs, and send suggestions to help us build this world together with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/c600aa02eb3cce192cd5cefe7169873e.avif?t=1738407926\" width=159 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still planning an english version...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/0631ce2c85c5275a45a6eb28cf750ddb.avif?t=1738407926\" width=616 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/bee7c9fc85f1ba8f873533c226f63e50.poster.avif?t=1738407926\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/bee7c9fc85f1ba8f873533c226f63e50.webm?t=1738407926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Welcome to the Early Access of Heroes of Noname!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/81043634689b24c6a62d8d98243974c9.webp?t=1738407926\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427310/extras/81043634689b24c6a62d8d98243974c9.poster.avif?t=1738407926\" 